{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中環發生傷人案。今日（15日）凌晨3時許，一名男子在皇后大道中29號對開位置報案，表示其年約20歲男性友人遇襲，臉部遭割傷，男傷者清醒由救護車送往瑪麗醫院接受治理。</p><p>就現場所見，警方到場跟進，正調查事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198496223343022080149870.jpeg/yEBhitU9bByJFa52qIKuHsNYAhqoEiKpzx7ePPUe3jw\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為皇后大道中29號。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198496220054556672943028.jpeg/wFGHpF-DjGMHb9fwyKRdjnOm1s0gZTyJd2mns01pp7M\"/><figcaption>現場為皇后大道中29號。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T22:11:40.402031+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T20:44:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T22:25:07.900103+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T22:04:53.838262+00:00","content_hash":"6fe79606a1bbdd55311646e2a39a31eaff3d6f16d694691cf7390e18458934fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}